            <ArticleTitle>Giant coronary artery aneurysm arising from sinus node artery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1373-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A giant coronary aneurysm arising from the sinus node artery is reported. Diagnosis of this lesion by computed tomography and angiography is illustrated. The operative management is described. &quot;Off-pump&quot; aneurysmectomy was successfully performed. The role of occlusion test of the aneurysm inflow tract is emphasized.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
